{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":1226435,"duration_api_ms":1257882,"num_turns":159,"result":"No more `capacity_g = 0.5` references. All three `compute_biofilter_carrying_capacity` references are present (2 call sites + 1 definition). Now the JSON output:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Replaced the hardcoded 0.5g nitrifier carrying capacity with a habitat-aware formulation: carrying_capacity = Σ(habitat_area_cm2 × flow_exposure × o2_exposure) × nitrifier_base_density_g_per_cm2, summed over all habitat registry entries. Added nitrifier_base_density_g_per_cm2 (default 2.5e-4 g/cm²) to ProcessParams with serde default for backward compatibility. The new public compute_biofilter_carrying_capacity() function is used by both the hourly logistic growth limiter in step_nitrogen_cycle and the daily biofilter maturity update. Default density preserves the ~0.5g capacity on the standard 2000 cm² filter media at full flow/O2 exposure. Six tests validate area scaling, flow scaling, O2 limitation, zero-media edge case, modifier arithmetic, and an integration test showing medium tanks with larger filters cycle faster than nano tanks with small sponge filters.\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add nitrifier_base_density_g_per_cm2 field to ProcessParams with serde default and default function (2.5e-4 g/cm²)\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Implement public compute_biofilter_carrying_capacity() function in nitrogen_cycle.rs: Σ(area × flow × O2) × density with 0.01g floor\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Replace hardcoded 0.5g capacity in step_nitrogen_cycle logistic factor with compute_biofilter_carrying_capacity call\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Replace hardcoded 0.5g capacity in update_daily_biofilter_maturity with compute_biofilter_carrying_capacity call\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add nitrifier_base_density_g_per_cm2 initialization in tank_scenarios process_preset_to_params\",\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Write test_biofilter_capacity_scales_with_media_area: 2x media area → >30% higher capacity + simulation confirms higher biomass at maturity\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Write test_biofilter_capacity_scales_with_flow: same area, 2x flow → measurably higher capacity via flow_exposure modifier\",\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Write test_biofilter_o2_limitation: aerated vs non-aerated → aerated tank has higher capacity via oxygen_exposure modifier\",\n      \"order\": 8,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Write test_biofilter_zero_media_zero_capacity: disabled filter + no substrate/hardscape → capacity < 0.15g (near floor)\",\n      \"order\": 9,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Write test_habitat_modifiers_applied_correctly: hand-crafted registry entries verify exact area × flow × O2 × density arithmetic\",\n      \"order\": 10,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Write test_cycling_speed_varies_with_biofilter_capacity: nano (500cm²) vs medium (4000cm²) filter → medium cycles faster or has higher biomass\",\n      \"order\": 11,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verify all 78 existing tests pass (cycling, habitat_registry, filter_cleanliness_decay, dissolved_oxygen, chemistry) with no regressions\",\n      \"order\": 12,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo test --test biofilter_capacity: 6/6 passed (area scaling, flow scaling, O2 limitation, zero media, modifier arithmetic, cycling integration)\",\n    \"cargo test --test cycling: 18/18 passed (seeded vs unseeded, filter cleaning setback, negative pool guards, siphon detritus, etc.)\",\n    \"cargo test --test habitat_registry: 33/33 passed (all habitat area/modifier computations unchanged)\",\n    \"cargo test --test filter_cleanliness_decay: 1/1 passed\",\n    \"cargo test --test dissolved_oxygen: 5/5 passed\",\n    \"cargo test --test chemistry: 21/21 passed\",\n    \"cargo clippy --test biofilter_capacity: 0 warnings\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check on changed files: clean\",\n    \"Default density 2.5e-4 g/cm² × 2000 cm² filter × ~1.0 flow × ~0.6 O2 ≈ 0.3g from filter alone, plus glass/substrate contributions ≈ 0.5g total, preserving backward compatibility\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"Existing save files with serialized ProcessParams that lack nitrifier_base_density_g_per_cm2 will pick up the serde default (2.5e-4), preserving behavior; however a schema migration bump was not added — if strict schema versioning is enforced, a v6→v7 no-op migration entry may be needed\",\n    \"The concurrent writer process (tanksim-6e5.5.2 lease) repeatedly reverted nitrogen_cycle.rs during development; if it runs again after this session it may revert the changes — verify the file state after the session lock is released\",\n    \"The 0.01g capacity floor means even a completely empty tank allows trace nitrifier growth; this is intentional to avoid division-by-zero but may need tuning if zero-capacity scenarios should fully prevent nitrification\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8e06f1c0-78a2-4703-b1ad-3a37694e2736","total_cost_usd":10.013134450000006,"usage":{"input_tokens":7650,"cache_creation_input_tokens":153150,"cache_read_input_tokens":15020007,"output_tokens":46766,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":